  "is_atomic": true,
  "atomic_questions": [
    "Are there any other constraints or requirements I should know about — such as minimum production levels for any component, setup times, or other business rules — or is the model fully described by the workshop capacities, production rates, and the goal of maximizing complete products?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response asks a single clarification question seeking to confirm if the model is fully described or if additional constraints exist. Although it lists examples (minimum levels, setup times), they are part of a single inquiry about the completeness of the current model description."
}
